{"unit_id":"jeremy9682__dsh-observability#card-zh","repo":"jeremy9682/dsh-observability","commit":"f5bdac556c0f4e6b61bd89201ec0e2401fb45c8e","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-observability 是面向网页端 DSH 的插件集合，包含子代理会话归因和 Cursor 委派工具。归因插件在指定工具执行前后为配置的会话目录建立文件指纹，并将新建或变化的产物归类为单个归因、并发歧义或未观察到；启用后把只含指针的信封追加到本地日志，也会记录到 DSH logger。独立 CLI 可包装其他本地命令并分类首事件、空闲和总时长超时。Cursor 工具注册 cursor_delegate，支持 ask、plan、edit 模式、模型和工作目录参数，并将结果或运行错误返回。需要配置本地会话目录；Cursor 委派还需要本机 cursor-agent 和有效登录。","source":"generated","evidence":["plugin-cursor/src/index.ts:36-115"]}
{"unit_id":"jeremy9682__dsh-observability#card-en","repo":"jeremy9682/dsh-observability","commit":"f5bdac556c0f4e6b61bd89201ec0e2401fb45c8e","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-observability attributes subagent runs to changed local session files and can record pointers in a journal. Its standalone CLI classifies run timeouts. A DSH tool delegates tasks to the local Cursor agent in ask, plan, or edit mode. Cursor use requires an active login.","source":"generated","evidence":["plugin-cursor/src/index.ts:36-115"]}
