{"unit_id":"jeremy9682__dsh-observability#feature-1","repo":"jeremy9682/dsh-observability","commit":"f5bdac556c0f4e6b61bd89201ec0e2401fb45c8e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-observability 的功能「子代理会话归因」：匹配配置的工具运行前后对会话根目录做文件指纹比较，输出会话引用及归因状态，并按需追加到本地 JSONL 日志。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:40-76"]}
